{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "when": {
        "source": {
          "kind": "stream",
          "event": "capabilities",
          "path": "connected"
        },
        "op": "eq",
        "value": false
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "title": "Not connected to a machine",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "title": "This module works through a machine you are connected to",
              "lines": [
                "It reaches the rest of your network from there: SSH to find machines and install the agent, then HTTP to everything the agent runs.",
                "Connect to a machine on the same network as the fleet - the machine list is in the sidebar - and this page fills in by itself."
              ],
              "tone": "info"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "source": {
              "kind": "stream",
              "event": "capabilities",
              "path": "problem"
            },
            "op": "exists"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "section",
              "title": "This machine cannot reach the fleet",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "keyValue",
                  "source": {
                    "kind": "stream",
                    "event": "capabilities"
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "key": "sshVersion",
                      "label": "SSH client"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "problem",
                      "label": "Problem"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "What to do",
                  "lines": [
                    "Something the module cannot work without is missing on the machine you are connected to, so nothing has been read and no figure below would be real.",
                    "Module settings lists every tool it looks for. Install the missing ones there, or connect to a machine that already has them."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                },
                {
                  "type": "actions",
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "label": "Check again",
                      "method": "sweepNow"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "when": {
                "source": {
                  "kind": "stream",
                  "event": "capabilities",
                  "path": "warning"
                },
                "op": "exists"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "Working, with something worth knowing",
                  "lines": [
                    "The fleet is being read, and one thing about the machine you are connected to makes it slower or less precise than it could be. Module settings names it."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "subnav",
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "library",
                  "label": "Library",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "conditional",
                      "when": {
                        "source": {
                          "kind": "stream",
                          "event": "ui",
                          "path": "hintsOn"
                        },
                        "op": "eq",
                        "value": true
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "What a template is",
                          "lines": [
                            "A JSON document describing one service: which containers or units it owns, and which values it needs from you. The agent runs it from a fixed list of operations - it can never contain a shell command - which is what makes it safe to write one and push it to fifty machines.",
                            "Six ship with the module and cannot be edited in place. To change one, export it, edit it and import it back under the same id: the library then shows it as yours."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Templates",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "table",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "invoke",
                            "method": "templateRows",
                            "intervalKey": "service-fleet"
                          },
                          "columns": [
                            {
                              "key": "id",
                              "label": "Id"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "name",
                              "label": "Name"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "kind",
                              "label": "Kind"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "version",
                              "label": "Version"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "originLabel",
                              "label": "Origin"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "units",
                              "label": "Units"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "fields",
                              "label": "Fields",
                              "align": "right"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "updatedAt",
                              "label": "Changed",
                              "format": "time"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowKey": "id",
                          "sortDefault": {
                            "key": "id",
                            "dir": "asc"
                          },
                          "filterKeys": [
                            "id",
                            "name",
                            "kind",
                            "originLabel",
                            "units"
                          ],
                          "groupModes": [
                            {
                              "id": "origin",
                              "label": "By origin",
                              "key": "originLabel"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "kind",
                              "label": "By kind",
                              "key": "kind"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowActions": [
                            {
                              "label": "Delete",
                              "method": "templateDelete",
                              "argsFromRow": [
                                "id"
                              ],
                              "confirm": "Remove this template from the library? Anything already deployed from it keeps running.",
                              "kind": "danger"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowDetail": [
                            {
                              "type": "section",
                              "title": "What it does",
                              "blocks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "keyValue",
                                  "source": {
                                    "kind": "invoke",
                                    "method": "templateDetail",
                                    "args": [
                                      "$row.id"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "rows": [
                                    {
                                      "key": "name",
                                      "label": "Name"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "kind",
                                      "label": "Kind"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "version",
                                      "label": "Version"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "origin",
                                      "label": "Origin"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "description",
                                      "label": "Description"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "units",
                                      "label": "Units"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "privileged",
                                      "label": "Runs a shell as root"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "section",
                              "title": "Fields it asks for",
                              "blocks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "table",
                                  "source": {
                                    "kind": "invoke",
                                    "method": "templateFields",
                                    "args": [
                                      "$row.id"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "columns": [
                                    {
                                      "key": "label",
                                      "label": "Field"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "input",
                                      "label": "Kind"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "required",
                                      "label": "Required"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "secret",
                                      "label": "Secret"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "help",
                                      "label": "What it is"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "rowKey": "id",
                                  "emptyText": "This template needs nothing filled in."
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "section",
                              "title": "Export",
                              "blocks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "conditional",
                                  "when": {
                                    "source": {
                                      "kind": "stream",
                                      "event": "ui",
                                      "path": "hintsOn"
                                    },
                                    "op": "eq",
                                    "value": true
                                  },
                                  "blocks": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "note",
                                      "title": "How to copy one",
                                      "lines": [
                                        "Below is this template exactly as it is stored. Copy it, change what you need, and paste it into Import - the id inside decides which template it replaces."
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "list",
                                  "source": {
                                    "kind": "invoke",
                                    "method": "templateExport",
                                    "args": [
                                      "$row.id"
                                    ],
                                    "path": "lines"
                                  },
                                  "columns": [
                                    {
                                      "key": "line"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "limit": 400,
                                  "emptyText": "This template could not be read back."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ],
                          "emptyText": "No templates loaded. That should not happen - six ship with the module, so this means they could not be read."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "import",
                  "label": "Import",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "note",
                      "title": "What the check step does",
                      "lines": [
                        "It parses the JSON, then validates it against the same rules the agent enforces - the operation list, the directories a template may write to, the requirement that every download carries a SHA-256.",
                        "It reports everything wrong at once rather than one thing per attempt, and nothing is stored until it passes."
                      ],
                      "tone": "info"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Import a template",
                      "columns": 2,
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "conditional",
                          "when": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "ui",
                              "path": "hintsOn"
                            },
                            "op": "eq",
                            "value": true
                          },
                          "blocks": [
                            {
                              "type": "note",
                              "title": "What each field means",
                              "lines": [
                                "Choose a file - a .json file exported from here or written by hand.",
                                "Or paste it - the same thing, for when copying text is easier than moving a file. Whichever of the two is filled in is used; the file wins if both are.",
                                "The id inside the document decides what it is called. Importing one whose id matches an existing template replaces it."
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "checkForm",
                          "checkMethod": "templateImportCheck",
                          "applyMethod": "templateImportApply",
                          "fields": [
                            {
                              "key": "file",
                              "label": "Choose a file",
                              "input": "file",
                              "accept": ".json",
                              "maxKb": 512
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "document",
                              "label": "Or paste it here",
                              "input": "textarea",
                              "placeholder": "{ \"id\": \"my-service\", \"displayName\": \"My service\", ... }"
                            }
                          ],
                          "checkLabel": "Check it",
                          "applyLabel": "Save to the library"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Writing one",
                      "columns": 2,
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "conditional",
                          "when": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "ui",
                              "path": "hintsOn"
                            },
                            "op": "eq",
                            "value": true
                          },
                          "blocks": [
                            {
                              "type": "note",
                              "title": "The rules a template has to follow",
                              "lines": [
                                "kind is \"container\" for Docker or \"service\" for a systemd unit. Exactly one unit has to be marked primary - it decides the instance's state and is whose log you get by default.",
                                "fields are what the user fills in. Mark anything sensitive secret: it is then masked in logs and never returned by the agent's API.",
                                "Values reach a command through {{field}}, and each one always becomes exactly one argument - a password containing a space or a semicolon cannot turn into two arguments.",
                                "A download must carry a sha256. It may come from a field, so a generic template can ask the operator for both - but it can never be absent.",
                                "writeFile and mkdir are limited to /etc/systemd/system, /opt, /usr/local/bin and the module's own directories.",
                                "There is no way to write a shell command, except the script operation - and that needs \"privileged\": true, which this app warns about loudly before deploying."
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
